OL,3,AMissing woman found 'safe and well'
OL,4,Aafter appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA missing woman has been found safe and
OL,7,Fwell after a police appeal to find her.
OL,9,FLeicestershire Police said Charlie Ryan
OL,10,Fwas reported missing on Friday morning.
OL,12,FThe force said the 31-year-old was
OL,13,Ffound in the Leicester area on Sunday.
OL,15,FOfficers thanked the public for sharing
OL,16,Ftheir appeal and contacting them with
OL,17,Finformation.
